id=minsos-tab-s7-smooth
name=MinsOS Tab S7 Smoothness & 120Hz Fix
version=v1.1.0
versionCode=110
author=iridite
description=Fixes notification shade frame drops on Galaxy Tab S7 (T870) running MinsOS One UI 8.5/Android 16. Locks 120Hz, relaxes SurfaceFlinger VSYNC offset, enables native GPU Kawase blur, tunes Schedutil/VFS/ART heap, and enables TCP Westwood+ for Wi-Fi.
